thbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb P\\in M\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ProperCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ProperCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}proper\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ProperCondition}_S(M,\\theta,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},p)\\leftrightarrow \\theta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land|M|=\\omega\\land M\\prec H_\\theta\\land\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\left(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\\exists s\\in D\\cap M\\;\\exists t\\in\\mathbb P\\;(t\\leq_{\\mathbb P}r\\land t\\leq_{\\mathbb P}s)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}proper\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ProperCondition}_S(M,\\theta,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\m